      "resource":{"class":"CACHE_FIRST_BOUNDED_READ","d1ReadMax":1,"d1WriteMax":0,"d1ReadRowsMax":200,"d1WriteRowsMax":0,"rpcMax":2,"responseItemsMax":50,"candidateItemsMax":500},
      "pagination":{"style":"OPAQUE_CURSOR","pageSizeMax":50,"stableSortRequired":true},
      "cache":{"mode":"PRIVATE_USER_SCOPED","public":false,"singleFlight":true,"ttlSecondsMax":30,"staleWhileRevalidateSeconds":120},
      "retry":{"maxAttempts":1,"clientRetrySafe":true},
